statement:
There are `n` boxes labelled `0` to `n - 1`, described by four arrays of length `n`:

- `status[i]` is `1` when box `i` is already unlocked and `0` when it is locked;
- `candies[i]` is the number of candies inside box `i`;
- `keys[i]` lists the labels of the boxes whose keys lie inside box `i`;
- `containedBoxes[i]` lists the labels of the boxes lying inside box `i` (a box sits inside at most one other box).

At the start you hold the boxes listed in `initialBoxes`. You may open any box you hold if it is unlocked or you have found its key, in any order you like. Opening a box gives you all of its candies, all of the keys inside it and all of the boxes inside it, which you then hold. Keys are never used up. Return the largest total number of candies you can collect.

validator:
function validate([status, candies, keys, containedBoxes, initialBoxes]) {
  const n = status.length;
  if (n < 1 || n > 1000) return 'There must be 1 to 1000 boxes.';
  if (candies.length !== n || keys.length !== n || containedBoxes.length !== n) return 'status, candies, keys and containedBoxes must all have the same length.';
  if (status.some(s => s !== 0 && s !== 1)) return 'Each status is 0 or 1.';
  if (candies.some(c => !Number.isInteger(c) || c < 1 || c > 1000)) return 'Each box holds 1 to 1000 candies.';
  const label = v => Number.isInteger(v) && v >= 0 && v < n;
  const inside = new Array(n).fill(false);
  for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {
    if (keys[i].length > n || !keys[i].every(label)) return 'Every key is a box label from 0 to n - 1.';
    if (new Set(keys[i]).size !== keys[i].length) return 'A box cannot hold the same key twice.';
    if (containedBoxes[i].length > n || !containedBoxes[i].every(label)) return 'Every contained box is a label from 0 to n - 1.';
    if (new Set(containedBoxes[i]).size !== containedBoxes[i].length) return 'A box cannot list the same inner box twice.';
    for (const b of containedBoxes[i]) {
      if (inside[b]) return 'A box can sit inside at most one other box.';
      inside[b] = true;
    }
  }
  if (initialBoxes.length > n || !initialBoxes.every(label)) return 'initialBoxes holds at most n labels from 0 to n - 1.';
  return null;
}

